    "body": "Is it possible to send array within form or query param?\r\n\r\n```\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<h2>HTML Forms</h2>\r\n\r\n<!-- Simple form which will send a POST request -->\r\n<form action=\"http://localhost:8000/test\" method=\"post\">\r\n  <label for=\"POST-name\">Name:</label>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"comment[]\" value=\"comment1\"/>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"comment[]\" value=\"comment2\"/>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"comment[]\" value=\"comment3\"/>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"comment[]\" value=\"comment4\"/>\r\n\r\n  <input type=\"submit\" value=\"Save\">\r\n</form>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n```\r\n\r\nPosting this form results in a string rather than array:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2333381/66778279-80e87300-eecb-11e9-84e3-75867a6043d6.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
